WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.320
Now, let's talk about the philosophy that powers this entire experience.

00:06.320 --> 00:07.320
Athleadership.

00:07.320 --> 00:14.240
It's where the mindset of an elite athlete meets the mastery of next-level leadership.

00:14.240 --> 00:17.000
You are in the Athleadership arena.

00:17.000 --> 00:23.800
And it is the space that we condition you with content, community, and analytics that

00:23.800 --> 00:27.040
drive lifelong results.

00:27.040 --> 00:32.440
You see, elite athletes don't just show up on game day and hope for the best.

00:32.440 --> 00:36.040
They build mental muscle memory.

00:36.040 --> 00:40.920
They condition their bodies and mind through disciplined practice.

00:40.920 --> 00:42.640
They have a system.

00:42.640 --> 00:45.620
We believe the best leaders do the same.

00:45.620 --> 00:50.440
They lead from their core and play for impact.

00:50.440 --> 01:02.840
That's the power of athlete leadership rooted in neuroscience and performance psychology,

01:02.840 --> 01:06.480
where mental conditioning meets purpose.

01:06.480 --> 01:10.280
This is where science meets soul.

01:10.280 --> 01:12.480
This is what we're here to do.

01:12.480 --> 01:18.000
Condition your leadership muscles so that when the pressure is on, you don't just endure.

01:18.000 --> 01:20.040
You excel.

01:20.040 --> 01:24.080
And if you've never seen yourself as an athlete, it's okay.

01:24.080 --> 01:28.000
This isn't about playing sports, running fast, or lifting weights.

01:28.000 --> 01:33.440
It's about unlocking the discipline, the mental clarity, and the inner strength already in

01:33.440 --> 01:36.220
you to win from within.

01:36.220 --> 01:42.120
Your championship season is built around a powerful foundational framework we call the

01:42.120 --> 01:44.120
M.V.P. blueprint.

01:44.120 --> 01:49.760
M.V.P. stands for your mission, your vision, and your purpose.

01:49.800 --> 01:56.680
A significant challenge in leadership is that fewer than 20% of leaders have a strong sense

01:56.680 --> 01:59.120
of their individual purpose.

01:59.120 --> 02:05.080
But for the 10% who actually do, it becomes their greatest advantage.

02:05.080 --> 02:09.800
The M.V.P. framework is your foundation for forever.

02:09.800 --> 02:17.080
I can tell you from my own journey, the moment I felt a drift, it's where the moment I lost

02:17.080 --> 02:19.880
sight of my own M.V.P.

02:19.880 --> 02:26.040
The journey back to it is what turned pain into purpose, and it's what built a foundation

02:26.040 --> 02:29.720
of winning in every area of my life.

02:29.720 --> 02:36.080
Your M.V.P. blueprint is that engine, and the Core 4 muscles, sometimes we refer to them

02:36.080 --> 02:41.400
as the A.R.A.W. framework, are the wheels that drive you forward.

02:41.400 --> 02:49.960
Through this season, every drill, every reflection, is designed to strengthen these four key areas,

02:49.960 --> 02:52.360
which are more than competencies.

02:52.360 --> 02:57.200
They are character building in real time and in real life.

02:57.200 --> 02:58.480
Why?

02:58.480 --> 03:01.880
Because the test of leadership is not in comfort.

03:01.880 --> 03:07.080
It's in times of uncertainty, pressure, and change.

03:07.080 --> 03:10.440
So how do we translate this into real world results?

03:10.480 --> 03:14.040
Through a system we call the 90-Day Way.

03:14.040 --> 03:19.120
This is your personal operating system that will not only get you through this program,

03:19.120 --> 03:25.040
but will serve you season after season in every area of your life.

03:25.040 --> 03:31.240
Research suggests that 92% of people who set goals fail to achieve them.

03:31.240 --> 03:35.120
The difference isn't the goal, it's the system.

03:35.120 --> 03:43.320
The 90-Day Way provides a structure to set clear, meaningful goals tied to your M.V.P. blueprint.

03:43.320 --> 03:49.760
Take consistent action and build unstoppable momentum one 90-day season at a time.

03:49.760 --> 03:55.040
We'll dive deep into this further into your experience, but today I want you to know that

03:55.040 --> 04:01.480
this is a system that will turn your intention into undeniable impact and make you a part

04:01.480 --> 04:06.280
of the new league of leaders, the 10% who actually do.

04:06.280 --> 04:12.120
To guide you through this process, you have an essential toolkit, your M.V.P. playbook.

04:12.120 --> 04:14.880
Now this isn't just a companion workbook.

04:14.880 --> 04:16.360
It is the work.

04:16.360 --> 04:20.480
It is your sacred space for conditioning.

04:20.480 --> 04:25.760
Inside your playbook, you'll find the A.R.A.W. conditioning drills, the worksheets to architect

04:25.760 --> 04:33.120
your M.V.P. blueprint and your 90-Day Way core scorecard to track your progress.

04:33.120 --> 04:39.320
It's where you'll do the reps, the reflection of the plays and design your next bold move.

04:39.320 --> 04:43.600
I encourage you to download your playbook now before you move on.

04:43.600 --> 04:45.280
Take a moment to look through it.

04:45.280 --> 04:48.080
Familiarize yourself with the layout.

04:48.080 --> 04:52.360
This is your personal training ground for the entire season.

04:52.360 --> 04:57.600
On it, you'll find your first drill, setting your why for this season.

04:57.600 --> 04:59.520
This isn't just a task.

04:59.520 --> 05:01.520
It's your commitment.

05:01.520 --> 05:04.240
It's your first step to owning your journey.

